The '''Dolphin Trainer''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|West Village}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
Once the player enters the '''Dolphin Trainer''' they will gain effects similar to that of a dolphin: they will glide through the water and when surfacing, will leap into the air.

At the end of the cave is an [[Enigma Soul]] and a {{ID|Teleport Pad!Teleport Pad|nolink=true}} leading {{mctxt|f|Out!|size=11}} which when stepped on will teleport the player back to the [[West Village]].

